    "title": "Multiple upcoming Pulaski County meetings - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Becca Shepherd ,\n18 hours ago Pulaski County officials have shared two upcoming, specially-called, public meetings. The Pulaski County Tourism Advisory Council will be holding a meeting this upcoming Monday, June 8th, at noon Eastern Time. The meeting will be in room 201 of the Pulaski County Courthouse, located at 112 East Main Street in Winamac. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
